t its mode to \"Multiply\"?Could you make the background of this image transparent for me?Could you create a new column called\"Average Sales\" for each product in Zones 1, 2,I would like to pad all the numbers in the 'Oldand 3 by calculating the average of Q1, Q2,ID' column with zeros in front, to fill them upOfficeCould you add the hyperlink Q3, and Q4?to seven digits in the 'New 7 Digit ID' column.\"https://its.example.com\" to the textExport the current document into PDF, keep\"Information Technology Services (ITS)\" inthe file namethe main content?Could you create a folder calledUse terminal command to count all the linesOS\"WorkProjects\" in your home directory and putof all php files in current directory recursively,a copy of \"installed_packages.txt\" inside it?show the result on the terminalVLCCould you adjust the playback speed in VLC to 1.5x for this video? I want to finish it faster, even if the audio isn't perfect.Help me modify the folder used to store my recordings to DesktopI'd like to stop the Welcome Page fromVS Codeshowing up every time I open VS Code. Canyou help me with that?","level":1,"path_id":"1~47","parent_section_id":null,"order_in_parent":49,"section_id":"sec-1~47"},{"title":"Table 7 :","text":"7Examples of generated tasks and test tasks on AndroidLabAppsGenerated Task InstructionsTest Task InstructionsClockSet an alarm for 5:30AM every Tuesday and Thursday, label it as \"Workout\", and disable vibrate.I need to set a 10:30PM clock every weekend, and label it as \"Watch Football Games\" to remind me. Does my alarm at 4PM turn on vibrate?CalendarArrange an event titled \"project deadline\" on March 15th, and attach a note saying \"Submit by noon.\"I want to add an event at 5:00PM today, whose Title is \"work\".","level":1,"path_id":"1~48","parent_section_id":null,"order_in_parent":50,"section_id":"sec-1~48"}],"citations":[{"raw_text":"JAchiam\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tSAdler\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tSAgarwal\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\tLAhmad\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\